              Basic Information            </a>
          </li>
                  <li class="c-sticky-nav__list js-things-to-do-post-nav-list">
            <a class="c-sticky-nav__link js-things-to-do-post-nav-link" href="#flower-report">
              Flower Report            </a>
          </li>
                  <li class="c-sticky-nav__list js-things-to-do-post-nav-list">
